OL,3,GNEWSALaughing gas canisters found
OL,4,Adumped near playground
OL,5,
OL,6,FLitter pickers say they are finding an
OL,7,Fincreasing amount of dumped laughing
OL,8,Fgas canisters in Leicester.
OL,10,FA haul of almost 200 nitrous oxide
OL,11,Fcanisters was found in the wooded area
OL,12,Fclose to the Goldhill Adventure
OL,13,FPlayground on Monday.
OL,15,FThe possession of nitrous oxide, or
OL,16,Flaughing gas, to "wrongfully inhale it
OL,17,Ffor a psychoactive effect" is a
OL,18,Fcriminal offence in England and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
