OL,3,GNEWSALaughing gas canisters found
OL,4,Adumped near playground
OL,5,
OL,6,FRango's Wombly Walkies, a litter
OL,7,Fpicking group, said the haul -
OL,8,Fdiscovered dumped in 33 black bin bags
OL,9,Fnear the playground - was the most they
OL,10,Fhad found in one go and the issue was
OL,11,Fgetting "worse and worse".
